{"version":1,"content":"<p>【信用危機 ⚠️】美國非牟利調查媒體《ProPublica》披露，特朗普（Donald Trump）展開第二任期數月後，國土安全部（DHS）政治任命官員曾向轄下專責網絡安全的「網絡安全和基礎設施安全局」（CISA）提出極不尋常的要求：秘密取得並入侵一台投票機，而且一旦發現系統漏洞，亦不得通知投票機廠商。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T15:20:01.515917+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":152,"images":0,"source":"HKEPC","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T15:13:08+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T18:57:46.034262+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T15:17:44.680873+00:00","content_hash":"2511071a12151b534e5f5e3c7d2e09b8edae384de4002a512f13c6f7fe055e14","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}